  "name": "Lotus Grand Hotel",
  "starRating": 4,
  "descriptions": [
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "RXLContentId",
      "text": "8836227"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "SurroundingArea",
      "text": "With a stay at Lotus Grand Hotel in Dubai (Deira), you\u0027ll be a 4-minute walk from Al Ghurair Centre and within a 5-minute drive of Dubai Creek.  This spa hotel is 2.7 mi (4.3 km) from Gold Souk and 4.7 mi (7.5 km) from Dubai World Trade Centre."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "RoomTypes",
      "text": "Make yourself at home in one of the 98 guestrooms featuring minibars. Complimentary wireless internet access is available to keep you connected. Private bathrooms with showers feature complimentary toiletries and hair dryers. Conveniences include safes and desks, as well as phones with free local calls."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "PropertyInformation",
      "text": "Relax at the full-service spa, where you can enjoy massages, body treatments, and facials. If you\u0027re looking for recreational opportunities, you\u0027ll find a nightclub and a health club. Additional amenities at this hotel include complimentary wireless internet access, concierge services, and a hair salon."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "AreaActivities",
      "text": "Distances are displayed to the nearest 0.1 mile and kilometer. \u003Cbr /\u003E \u003Cp\u003EAl Ghurair Centre - 0.3 km / 0.2 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Fish Roundabout - 0.8 km / 0.5 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Reef Mall - 0.9 km / 0.6 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Deira Clocktower - 1.3 km / 0.8 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Deira Twin Towers Shopping Centre - 1.3 km / 0.8 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Naif Souq - 2.2 km / 1.3 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Creek Park - 2.2 km / 1.4 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E City Centre Deira - 2.3 km / 1.4 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Gold Souk - 2.7 km / 1.7 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Spice Souk - 2.7 km / 1.7 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Deira Spice Souq - 2.8 km / 1.8 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Dubai Museum - 3.3 km / 2.1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Textile Souk - 3.4 km / 2.1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Al Nasr Leisureland - 3.6 km / 2.2 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Grand Mosque - 3.7 km / 2.3 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe nearest airports are:\u003Cbr /\u003EDubai Intl. Airport (DXB) - 5.3 km / 3.3 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E Sharjah (SHJ-Sharjah Intl.) - 29.5 km / 18.3 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E Al Maktoum Intl. Airport (DWC) - 66.4 km / 41.3 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe preferred airport for Lotus Grand Hotel is Dubai Intl. Airport (DXB). \u003C/p\u003E"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "PoliciesDisclaimers",
      "text": "\u003Cul\u003E  \u003Cli\u003EExtra-person charges may apply and vary depending on property policy\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGovernment-issued photo identification and a credit card, debit card, or cash deposit may be required at check-in for incidental charges\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESpecial requests are subject to availability upon check-in and may incur additional charges; special requests cannot be guaranteed\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThis property accepts credit cards and cash\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECashless transactions are available\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENoise-free guestrooms cannot be guaranteed\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESafety features at this property include a security system\u003C/li\u003E  \u003C/ul\u003E \u003Cul\u003E  \u003Cli\u003EOnly registered guests are allowed in the guestrooms. \u003C/li\u003E \u003Cli\u003ECashless payment methods are available for all transactions.\u003C/li\u003E \u003C/ul\u003E"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "DiningFacilities",
      "text": "Enjoy a meal at the restaurant or snacks in the coffee shop/cafe. The hotel also offers 24-hour room service. Quench your thirst with your favorite drink at the bar/lounge. Buffet breakfasts are available daily from 7:00 AM to 10:00 AM for a fee."
    }
  ],
